    "description": {
      "id": "Saya Alan (Varland Lengkong), seorang IT professional yang memiliki ketertarikan pada teknologi dan kreativitas. Dengan latar belakang Teknik Informatika, saya mengembangkan solusi digital melalui software development, networking, dan desain, sekaligus mengeksplorasi storytelling melalui fotografi dan videografi. Bagi saya, teknologi bukan hanya tentang bagaimana sesuatu bekerja, tetapi juga bagaimana solusi tersebut dapat memberikan pengalaman yang baik bagi penggunanya.",
      "en": "I’m Alan (Varland Lengkong), an IT professional with a background in Informatics Engineering and experience in software development, networking, and creative technology. I combine an engineering mindset with creativity to build digital solutions that are functional, reliable, and visually engaging. Beyond technology, I explore visual storytelling through photography and videography.\n\nFor me, technology is not only about how things work, but also about how they can create meaningful and effective experiences for people."
    },
